<title>USA: API weekly petroleum figures delayed.</title>
<headline>API weekly petroleum figures delayed.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Petroleum Institute said its weekly petroleum report would be delayed at least until 5:30 p.m. EDT (2130 GMT).</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for API said the delay was caused by a computer problem. She gave no further details.</p>
<p>The report had been expected between 4 p.m. and 4:30 p.m.</p>
<p>((--Washington Newsroom 202-898-8300))</p>
